        "username": "MigrantP",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/migrantp/{size}/1921_2.png",
        "created_at": "2021-11-21T15:33:55.880Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Blazing_Vortex\" data-post=\"1\" data-topic=\"28936\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/eb8c5e/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Blazing_Vortex:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Can the second part of effect for pushing be only done if the first part is fulfilled (i.e. having blight)?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yes. Everything in that paragraph goes together. I suspect it’s only a new line because of word wrapping.</p>",
